                        },
                        "description": "Assigns or updates a model role for a user group. If the user group already has a role for the specified model, this endpoint will update it to the new role. All members of the user group will inherit this role.\n\nModel roles control what actions user group members can perform on models and connections. To manage user groups, see the User group APIs."
